        'Dear Team,  Kindly note that the system is currently very slow across multiple departments, especially Credit, which is impacting work progress.  For your urgent support  Regards,  Omar',
        'Dear Mr. @Tawfiq Abu Shareef | ????? ??? ????,    Based on the investigation conducted by the Pio-tech technical team regarding the Workflow Performance Issue, we would like to summarize the findings and actions taken as follows:    Root Causes Identified  • The email sending process is experiencing significant delays, and we believe this is the primary contributor to the workflow processing delay.  • Several database queries were identified as causing high resource utilization at the database level.  • Certain database jobs were consuming excessive database server resources.    Actions Taken  • The Pio-tech technical team requested that the bank temporarily suspend email sending activities until the email-related delay is resolved on the bank''s side.  • The Pio-tech technical team performed database tuning activities that are expected to improve query performance.  • The Pio-tech technical team conducted a comprehensive review of all database jobs and disabled any unnecessary jobs to minimize resource consumption and prevent future delays.    The Pio-tech team will continue to closely monitor this case and follow up until the end of this week. Kindly inform us immediately if you experience any workflow delays during this period.    Thank you for your cooperation.',
