        '21996',
        'Modify age criteria on production',
        'Modify age criteria on production',
        'Dear @mohammed.ayad,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:     • Issue Reported by the customer: Modify age criteria on production.     • Status: Solved.     • Problem description: Scenario ID 2000011 - "????? ???? ???? ????? ????? ???? ??? ?? ?????? ?? ??? ?????? ????? ???? ??? ????? ??? ????? ????? ?????" required modification in the production environment to align with the logic that was tested and approved in the test environment.    • Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, please note that Scenario ID 2000011 has been successfully modified in the production environment and aligned with the logic implemented and tested on the test environment. In addition, a new rule has been implemented using the AML_COL1 field in the TRANSACT table. This field is updated automatically on a daily basis during the fill process and is assigned the value "1" when all of the following conditions are met:    1. The customer''s expected monthly income is greater than 3,000,000.  2. The transaction amount divided by the customer''s expected monthly income is greater than 1.2 (Ratio > 1.2).  3. The transaction and customer information belong to the same customer and business date.    Once these conditions are satisfied, the transaction is marked with AML_COL1 = 1, and the scenario uses this value as part of its alert generation criteria.    Kindly check from your side and confirm so we can proceed with closing this ticket.',
