        'Dear Hamid,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:     • Issue Reported by the customer: Issue with Language Configuration on MIS Upgrade Reporting Serve    • Status: Done.     • Problem description: Arabic language was not supported in Oracle Client configuration    • Action Taken – recommended solution: Kindly note that the issue has been resolved by updating the Oracle Client NLS_LANG configuration to AMERICAN_AMERICA.AL32UTF8 in the Registry. This ensures full Arabic Unicode support, and the data is now displaying correctly.    • Kindly check and confirm so we may proceed with closing the ticket.',
