        'Dear Raghad     Kindly follow below steps for frequent BPM_CHECKS user password changes and use below encryption tool to encrypt password :    Change Password for BPM_CHECKS:   Step 1: Reset the Database User Password   The following SQL query was executed on the database to reset the password for the   BPM_CHECKS user:   ALTER USER BPM_CHECKS IDENTIFIED BY NewPass123;   Step 2: Use the provided encryption tool to generate an encrypted version of the new password.   Step 3: Update the Web Configuration File:   1. Open the following file:   C:\inetpub\wwwroot\BPM_CHECKS\Web.config   2. Locate the <connectionStrings> section.   3. Replace the existing encrypted password value with the newly generated encrypted password.   4. Save the file.   Step 4: Restart IIS if required.      EncryptionTools',
