        'Data mossing in system for 25-27 June',
        'Data mossing in system for 25-27 June',
        'Dear @Ibraheem Rafed,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:     • Issue Reported by the customer: Data mossing in system for 25-27 June.     • Status: Solved.     • Problem description: The RBA data was missing for the specified dates.    • Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, please note that the issue was caused by the BI_DWH tablespace becoming full, which prevented the RBA engine from processing the data correctly. After resolving the tablespace issue from our side, we successfully re-ran the RBA engine for the affected dates, and the missing data has been restored successfully.    Kindly check from your side and confirm so we can proceed with closing this ticket.',
