        'Dear Rana,    Based on our web session and the initial investigation conducted regarding the issue encountered while uploading (using the Send Data button) the Contract Custom Generated Report, the following error is displayed:  "Error: Security exception was thrown. Logged with Id: 7ae7db0b-b594-45bc-bf35-31b638a34731."         Based on our initial analysis, the issue appears to be related to the “CBI” service/URL rather than the BankBI Credit Bureau system.    Kindly share the above error details with the CBI team for further investigation and resolution, and keep us updated with their feedback.     Best Regards,',
