        'Dear Jaafar,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:     • Issue Reported by the customer: Request to add required fields    • Status: Done.     • Problem description: map and add core banking columns to the data warehouse schema .    • Action Taken – recommended solution: Kindly note that we have added all new columns to table PIO_CUSTOMERS and started filling them from 24-Jun-2026. Regarding adding these fields to the universes, a new ticket will be opened  Source Column (Core Banking) Target Columns (PIO_CUSTOMERS)  oth_first_name FIRST_NAME  oth_father_name FATHER_FIRST_NAME_ENGLISH  oth_gfather_name GRANDFATHER_FIRST_NAME_ENGLISH  oth_last_name last_name  oth_name_line1 OTHER_NAME_LINE1  oth_name_line2 OTHER_NAME_LINE2  oth_cus_sho_name OTHER_CUS_SHO_NAME    ? Kindly check and confirm so we may proceed with closing the ticket.',
