        'Dear @Hanan Vinar,    Based on our web session, please be informed that the alerts you provided are now appearing in the system as expected after we checked the workflow tables.    The issue was related to the alerts'' workflow. We have removed all incorrect workflow records associated with the provided alerts.    Kindly check and confirm so we can proceed with closing this ticket.',
