(
        '19317',
        'Interest Issue in PIO_ACT_RATE & PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST',
        'Regarding PIO_ACT_RATE:  • In case of Band is correct but you should consider the tier differential in table D9PF from column D9TDR0 to D9TDR9. You should join D9PF with D5PF to get differential value and add it in case of Debit and subtract it in case of Credit.  • Also if the balance is exactly as tier limit bracket (column D9TLV0 to D9TLV9), you shouldn’t take rate of next tier level but of current tier level. (For example : Account 0063-307064-201 with tier code INEZ has exactly 500 EGP, the rate you calculated is 16.5% (D9TBR1) while the correct rate is 0% (D9TBR0)  Regarding PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST: • Account has tier code and this tier code definition in table D9PF contains differential. The differential is considered in the ETL but it is added instead of being subtracted in credit. For example : Account 0002-265078-201, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 26.75 while the correct one is 21.25 • Some accounts with tier, their interest rate is not matching the core banking.  ? For example : Account 0004-564199-002, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 16 while correct one is 16.75.  I believe this is an issue with calculating the correct tier level (bracket) since account balance is over 6M but the rate calculated is for the range between 1M and 3M.  ? Another Example : Account 0002-103814-001, in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST the interest rate is 14.61 while correct one is 12.42.  I believe this is an issue with calculating the correct tier level (bracket) since account balance is over 100K but the rate calculated is for the range less than 100K  • Accounts with Margin Rate, the margin should be subtracted in credit and added in debit.  ? For example: Account 0069-626698-012, the interest rate in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST is 3.3289 while the correct one is 5.3289.  ? Another example : Account 1022-600634-007, the interest rate in PIO_ACCOUNT_INTEREST is 35.25 while the correct one is 12.75  Please support to fix those issues urgently and Please make sure that differential and margin is added in case of debit and is subtracted in case of credit.',
        NULL,
